    "Name": "Von Luckner VNL-K70",
    "Details": "Named for a legendary Terran raider, the Von Luckner was designed for the original Star League after the Reunification War. Few remain in service today. The Von Luckner was one of the few tanks to use a fusion engine, as most vehicle-mounted reactors were stripped out for use in 'Mechs during the Succession Wars.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       235     40\n<b>Left</b>         155     40\n<b>Right</b>       155     40\n<b>Rear</b>        150     40\n<b>Turret</b>      235     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      930    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>",
